OL,3,GNEWSAThe dance group helping with
OL,4,Aaddiction and mental health struggles
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a studio in Chester, dancers are
OL,7,Ffinessing the choreography for their
OL,8,Fforthcoming sold-out performance at the
OL,9,FRoyal Opera House in London.
OL,11,FWhile they have all bonded over a
OL,12,Fshared love of dancing, they have also
OL,13,Fovercome similar struggles to get here.
OL,15,F"We've all been through trauma and our
OL,16,Fown journey," explained Michelle
OL,17,FHughes.
OL,19,F"We're a supportive community."
